# asset_manifest.lua (bake output) is now committed: device/shipped builds (Android/iOS) require it,
# and the OCTARINE_SHIPPED gate means a committed manifest no longer freezes dev `-p` runs (those
# always rescan). Regenerate with `OctarineEngine <project> -m bake` after adding/renaming assets.